OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy and dry to start.
OL,6,FCloud developing through the day but
OL,7,Fremaining mostly dry with only a few
OL,8,Fisolated light showers. Temperatures
OL,9,Fnear normal..
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMainly clear and dry through
OL,12,Fthe evening. Cloud builds after sunset
OL,13,Fwith some patchy light rain at times
OL,14,Fovernight and into Thursday morning.
OL,15,FMild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FCloudy with light rain for
OL,18,Fmany to start the day, this slowly
OL,19,Fclears away through the late morning
OL,20,Fto leave a partly cloudy and dry
OL,21,Fafternoon. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
